workplan/pipeline-state-graph/IDEAL-GRAPH.md:892:**Where the ideal contradicts workplan v2:** §4 "cross-parameter synthesis: do not build" (A03 builds it); §4 slug × lens by logged query text (A05 uses FKs); step 0.2 lands T1 as built (A37 folds two of its tables); step 1.2 rebuilds `conflicts` (merged into `syntheses`); step 1.3 keeps `case_studies` (A36); Phase 3 evidence keeps a stored tier derived at `add-source` and promotes `adjudication_integrity` (A08 stores no tier, so the gate has nothing to check); step 1.6 keeps `medical_lens_integrity` (a CHECK replaces it); step 4.1 keeps `decline-parameter`, `add-icf-code`, `set-icf-title`, `add-population-icf-link` (merged into `add-parameter`, `add-lens-code`, `add-lens-crossing`); Phase 3 judgment removes the slug guard later (the ideal has no slug on extractions); the workplan keeps `gaps` for both uses (A25). Phases 0.1, 0.4, 1.1, 1.4, 1.5, 1.7, 1.8 and 3.R agree with the ideal.
